due to deviants being made, plus having to balance them out with all the other new monster abilities</div> </div> </div> </div>That's...a bit debatable.<br /> <br /> If memory serves, one of the design goals of HtV2e is that, despite the expansions in 1e and the other gamelines, HtV should still be able to stand on its own as a gameline without needing to rely on the other gamelines. And to allow for antagonist monsters for hunters to fight that aren't just either the other splats or their antagonists. While I don't think taking into account Deviant's stuff is an impossibility, I don't think it would be that big of a time sink.<br /> <br /> At most, I would expect a mention of Deviants in the Stereotypes section for each Compact and Conspiracy and maybe some mentions in the City Setting write-ups...but that's about it. Not as far as systems interactions.<br /> <br /> Any in depth explorations of Hunters vs Deviants would be saved for something like a standalone Mortal Remains release for Deviants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T18:53:37-07:00","id":1214871,"title":"","content":"Good point, forgot about them saying that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T09:0